# ---- QUMO / TA trading research — never repo content ----
#
# These patterns previously lived ONLY in .git/info/exclude, which is
# per-clone and never shared: on a fresh clone, in CI, or on a second
# machine, none of these files were ignored at all. That is how
# docs/qumo-desk-precommit.md and deploy/qumo-liq-collector.* reached a
# public repo — force-added to unbreak CI during a large PR, then never
# noticed. Moving the patterns here makes the exclusion travel with the
# repository instead of with one checkout.
/docs/altcoin-setups-*
/docs/altpivot-*
/docs/altsetup-*
/docs/baserate-*
/docs/brief-replay-*
/docs/crypto-brief-*
/docs/fibtime-*
/docs/hosodatime-*
/docs/joe-calls-*
/docs/joe-mining-*
/docs/phase1a-*
