/vps-backups/

# Client demo bundles: source workbooks, deterministic extracts, and the recipe
# templates that hard-reference them by path. Working material for showing the
# local-model privacy story, not shipped repo content — the templates cannot be
# split from demos/ because their input defaults point into it.
# Matched by PATTERN, not by name. This file is tracked and this repo is
# public, so listing demo bundles individually published their names — and a
# demo name can carry account context even when the bundle itself never
# leaves the machine. Add new demo bundles by extending the glob, never by
# naming them here.
/demos/
/templates/recipes/*-demo.yaml
